---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { BRAND_EMAIL } from '../lib/brand';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Pickraft"
  description="How Pickraft handles your data. Learn what information we collect and how we use it."
  canonical="/privacy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Summary</h2>
    <p>
      Pickraft provides free image tools online. We do not ask you to create an account.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Your images</h2>
    <p>
      When you use our conversion tools, we do not receive, store, or have access to the images you
      select.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Information we may collect</h2>
    <p class="mb-3">We do not collect personal information through our tools. Like most websites, basic technical data may be logged when you visit, such as:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
      <li>IP address</li>
      <li>Browser type and device information</li>
      <li>Pages visited and referring URL</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">
      This data is used to operate and secure the site. Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may process
      this information on our behalf.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Third-party services</h2>
    <p class="mb-3">We use the following third-party services that may collect data under their own policies:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
      <li>
        <strong class="type-subheading">Google Fonts</strong> — fonts are loaded from
        Google servers when you visit the site.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="type-subheading">Advertising partners</strong> — we may display ads
        from third-party networks. Those partners may use cookies or similar technologies to serve
        and measure ads.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We do not set cookies for account or tool functionality. Third-party advertisers may set
      cookies when ads are shown. You can control cookies through your browser settings.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Children</h2>
    <p>Pickraft is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes means you
      accept the updated policy.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="type-subheading mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? Email
      <a href={`mailto:${BRAND_EMAIL}`} class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">{BRAND_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
